        "text_cfkzBP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Foil adhesive tapes are an extremely versatile and durable solution for rugged and harsh applications. Reliable adhesion, good thermal/electrical conductivity, and resistances to chemicals, humidity, and UV radiation make foil tape one of the most popular options for military, aerospace, and industrial applications — particularly in outdoor operations.</p><p>At NADCO Tapes and Labels, Inc., we specialize in the development and production of custom tapes and labels for use in nearly any industry. With more than 30 years of experience, we have developed innovative adhesive tape solutions to withstand a broad range of extreme conditions. Our foil tapes are custom-manufactured for situational requirements using a variety of foil materials and designs.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
