        "heading_Eq3pwh": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "What are the Key Materials Used and Their Applications?",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "rich_text_cstm": "<p><a href=\"https://shopnadco.com/pages/foil-tape\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://shopnadco.com/pages/foil-tape\">Foil tapes</a> are available from a wide range of materials, including aluminum, lead, copper, and steel.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_hdLycG": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Aluminum tapes.",
            "content": "<p>Aluminum tapes incorporate aluminum foil and reliable adhesives into a highly durable tape that conforms easily to uneven surfaces. With high resistances to moisture, vapor, and temperature fluctuations, aluminum tape can provide a barrier over thermal insulation, such as aluminum-backed duct board and fiberglass. It is often used in packaging to protect sensitive contents from moisture intrusion and temperature fluctuations during shipping.<br/><br/></p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": true,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_YF3XDf": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Copper tapes. ",
            "content": "<p>Copper foil tapes can be manufactured in conductive and non-conductive variants. Available in lined and unlined designs, copper tape offers a high level of chemical and weather resistance, making it perfect for use in outdoor communication cable wrapping and electrostatic shielding.<br/><br/></p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_gFEkQc": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Lead tapes.",
            "content": "<p>Lead tapes are uniquely suited for masking applications in chemical mills, x-ray applications, and electroplating. They offer excellent moisture resistance and sometimes see use as a moisture barrier around windows and doors.<br/><br/></p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_TyAx4d": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Stainless steel tapes.",
            "content": "<p>Valued for its exceptional strength and corrosion resistance, stainless steel foil tape is used in applications that require an adhesive tape product with superior durability and the ability to conform easily to corners and uneven surfaces. Often found in outdoor applications, stainless steel tape resists UV radiation, thermal fluctuations, wear, and corrosion.<br/><br/></p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
