    "rich_text_LJRYjp": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_b9EYCq": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Working with an Industry Leader like NADCO",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_jCAjir": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As one of the industry’s premier providers of custom adhesive tape products and labels, NADCO maintains a reputation for exceptional quality adhesive solutions. Our 35,000-square-foot warehouse allows us to maintain a comprehensive stock of adhesive tapes and labels suitable for nearly any application. Our facility features state-of-the-art equipment that allows us to manufacture custom-printed tapes and labels up to 20 inches wide with four-color processing or up to seven spot colors.</p><p>We maintain ISO 9001:2015 quality certification and our shipping capabilities include everything from local delivery to international freight. No matter what your project requires, you can rest assured that NADCO’s adhesive tapes and labels will meet and exceed the most stringent industry standards and customer expectations. Our extensive selection of foil tapes can be custom-designed to meet the particular needs of even the most extreme applications.</p><p>To learn more about our foil tapes and other adhesive products, <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact us\">contact us today</a>!</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
